## 4. 4-Week Implementation Plan
* **Week 1 (Scoping, Data Model & Cleaning):** Data auditing, schema design (star schema with Bronze/Silver/Gold layers in SQL Server 2022), cleaning rules, and dataset freezing.
* **Week 2 (Demand, Skills & Salary Analysis):** Requirements matrix definition, exploratory analysis via Python and SQL, KPI finalization, and validation totals.
* **Week 3 (Forecasting & Trends):** Time-series aggregation, seasonal-naive/moving average/exponential smoothing forecasting models, salary association regression, and SQL dashboard views.
* **Week 4 (Dashboards, Report & Presentation):** Cross-tool dashboard builds in Tableau and Power BI, reconciliation checks, peer review, final report compilation, and GitHub repository polish.
